title: Scattered Treasures (Violin, Coins, Grail, Trident, Blue Sphere, Jade,
  Red Sphere)
story: dungeo
description: Collect 7 scattered treasures from existing regions. Restores
  from wt-11.

---

# Restore state from wt-11 (player at Living Room with torch and lantern)
$restore wt-11

# ============================================================================
# PASS 1: Collect violin, grail, screwdriver, trident
# Route: Kitchen (sack) → underground → Round Room (violin) → Grail Room (grail)
# → Deep Canyon → Reservoir → Atlantis (trident) → back to Living Room
# Screwdriver taken from Living Room at start (dropped there in wt-04)
# ============================================================================
# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get brown sack from Kitchen, then get violin from Round Room
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get brown sack and violin]

> east

> take brown sack

> west

> take screwdriver

> down

> east

> north

> east

> open box

> take violin

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get grail from Grail Room
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get grail]

> east

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get trident from Atlantis Room
# Route: Grail Room → Round Room → Deep Canyon → Reservoir South
# → Reservoir → Reservoir North → Atlantis Room
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get trident]

> west

> northwest

> northwest

> north

> north

> north

> take trident

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store Pass 1 treasures in trophy case
# Route: Atlantis → Reservoir South → Deep Canyon → Round Room → E/W Passage
# → Troll Room → Cellar → Living Room
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Store Pass 1 treasures]

> southeast

> south

> south

> up

> southeast

> west

> west

> west

> up

> open trophy case

> put violin in trophy case

> put trident in trophy case

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get bag of coins from Maze-5
# Route: Living Room → Cellar → Troll Room → Maze-1 → Maze-4 → Maze-3 → Maze-5
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get bag of coins]

> down

> east

# Maze-1 → E → Maze-4 → W → Maze-3 → UP → Maze-5 (coins here)
> south

> east

> west

> up

# Return: Maze-5 → N → Maze-3 → W → Maze-2 → S → Maze-1 → W → Troll Room
> north

> west

> south

> west

> west

> up

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# PASS 2: Puzzle treasures (need tools)
# ============================================================================
# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get welcome mat from West of House
# Route: Living Room → Kitchen → Behind House → North of House → West of House
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get welcome mat]

> east

> east

> north

> west

> take welcome mat

# Return: West of House → South of House → Behind House → Kitchen → Living Room
> south

> east

> west

> west

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Solve Tiny Room door puzzle and get blue crystal sphere
# Route: Living Room → Cellar → Troll Room → N/S Crawlway → Torch Room → Tiny Room
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get blue crystal sphere]

> down

> east

> east

> up

> west

> look

# Try to go north - blocked by locked door
> north

# Step 1: Put the mat under the door
> put mat under door

# Step 2: Push the key through the keyhole with the screwdriver
> push key with screwdriver

# Step 3: Pull the mat to get the key
> take mat

# Step 4: Unlock the door
> unlock door with key

# Step 5: Open the door
> open door

# Step 6: Go north to Dreary Room
> north

> look

# Drop tools before taking sphere
> drop screwdriver

> drop mat

> drop key

> take blue crystal sphere

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get jade figurine from Squeaky Room and red sphere from Sooty Room
# Route: Dreary Room → Tiny Room → Torch Room → Crawlway → Troll Room
# → E/W Passage → Round Room → Winding Passage → Mirror Room (State A)
# → rub mirror (State B) → Cold Passage → Slide Room → Mine Entrance
# → Squeaky Room (jade) → slide down → Sooty Room (red sphere) → Cellar
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get jade figurine and red sphere]

> south

> east

> down

> east

> north

> east

> southeast

# Mirror is State A (wt-11 toggled it back before exiting)
> east

# Toggle mirror to State B (Coal Mine connections)
> rub mirror

# Navigate to Squeaky Room via Cold Passage
> west

> west

> north

> northwest

> take jade figurine

# Navigate to Sooty Room via slide (one-way)
> south

> south

> down

> down

> down

> east

> south

> take red sphere

# Exit to Cellar via slide
> north

> up

> down

> down

> up

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store Pass 2 treasures in trophy case
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Store Pass 2 treasures]

> put blue crystal sphere in trophy case

> put jade in trophy case

> put red crystal sphere in trophy case

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Verify final state
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Verify state for next segment]

> inventory

> look

[END GOAL]

$save wt-12
